{"id":"n15050-3-7","stage":4,"title":"들여놓다 · 购置","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15050-3-7-1","ko":"집에 쌀이 떨어졌어요.","zh":"家里没米了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"집에","meaning":"家，屋","explanation":"집：家，屋；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"2","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"집에","audio":"/audio/a007fc659cc1512ff2b3.mp3"}},{"text":"쌀이","meaning":"米，大米","explanation":"쌀：米，大米；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"쌀","audio":"/audio/409668b14ff6c36e6073.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62094","senseId":"1","lemma":"쌀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쌀이","audio":"/audio/62bd5f51f645d0e90326.mp3"}},{"text":"떨어졌어요.","meaning":"不足，短缺，耗尽","explanation":"떨어지다：不足，短缺，耗尽；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"떨어지다","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89796","senseId":"19","lemma":"떨어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떨어졌어요","audio":"/audio/d750985f484c425ae8e1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家，屋","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"数人或动物为了生活而盖的建筑物的单位。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"409668b14ff6c36e","term":"쌀","zh":"米，大米","audio":"/audio/409668b14ff6c36e6073.mp3","entryId":"62094","definition":"做饭吃的，稻谷脱壳后的仁儿。","pronunciation":["쌀"]},{"id":"5360fef914150d39","term":"떨어지다","zh":"不足，短缺，耗尽","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3","entryId":"89796","definition":"没进行补充，所以现在没有剩余。","pronunciation":["떠러지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b4dfd439a2b6a4a23a23.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15050-3-7-2","ko":"내일 장에 가서 한 가마니 들여놓으마.","zh":"明天去市场买一袋回来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내일","meaning":"明天，明日","explanation":"내일：明天，明日。","readings":[{"term":"내일","audio":"/audio/1e07b94ba5182a41e7de.mp3"}],"